flowchart TB
    A[Inbound message] --> B[Compute cache key\n<i>digest of request, or a narrower ID field</i>]
    B --> C{Decision: cache hit?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Return cached response]
    C -->|No| E[HTTP.Request Task\ncall backend]
    E --> F[Store response in cache\nkeyed by B]
    F --> G[Return response]
